// W5-24 U3a/t, S-600 (spec §18.1: "`@` の属性の修正候補は、その属性を可視性と `rt` の前（既にある属性の後ろ）へ移す形である"): the E0002 of an attribute after `pub` of a
// flow (`pub @fp(relaxed) flow h` is `@fp(relaxed) pub flow h`) has one candidate, which writes the attribute before the
// visibility, and the file has no error left after it (`clean`, S-253). The main position is the attribute. A file with one unit,
// so that `clean` looks at the whole file.

@fp(relaxed) pub flow h(x: F32 at sample) -> F32 at sample {   //~ E0002
  x * 2.0
}
